{"title": "Spore Sacks", "pageid": 28201, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Spore_Sacks", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Spore Sacks</b> is a passive feature that grants extra spore druid abilities.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>While imbued with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Symbiotic_Entity_(Condition)\" title=\"Symbiotic Entity (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Symbiotic_Entity_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Symbiotic_Entity_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Symbiotic_Entity_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Symbiotic_Entity_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Symbiotic_Entity_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Symbiotic_Entity_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Symbiotic Entity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Symbiotic_Entity_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Symbiotic_Entity_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Symbiotic_Entity_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Symbiotic_Entity_(Condition)\" title=\"Symbiotic Entity (Condition)\">Symbiotic Entity</a>, you can spread <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bibberbang_Spores\" title=\"Bibberbang Spores\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Bibberbang_Spores_Icon.webp/25px-Bibberbang_Spores_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Bibberbang_Spores_Icon.webp/38px-Bibberbang_Spores_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Bibberbang_Spores_Icon.webp/50px-Bibberbang_Spores_Icon.webp 2x\"><img al